# Keep repository internals off the public site.
#
# The Hub deploys its repo root as static assets, so without this file Cloudflare
# served the .git folder (found 2026-09-17: /.git/config, /.git/HEAD and /.git/index
# all returned 200 — enough to rebuild the whole repo) plus README.md.
#
# Nothing below is loaded by the app. index.html, staff.html, update-check.js,
# assets/ and _headers are deliberately NOT listed — ignoring any of them would
# break the launcher or drop its security headers.
.git/
docs/
scripts/
tmp/
*.md
wrangler.jsonc
.gitignore
.assetsignore
